    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "그녀는 나를 보자 울음을 터뜨렸다",
      "text": "On seeing me, she burst into cry. or No sooner had she seen me than she burst into cry. or She burst into cry at my <b>sight</b>."
