    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "그 녀석 꼴도 보기 싫다",
      "text": "I hate the very <b>sight</b> of him. or The very <b>sight</b> of him makes me sick[is quite disgusting]."
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "네 꼴이 그게 뭐냐!",
      "text": "Look at you! or What a <b>sight</b>! or What bad shape you are in! or How dreadful (of you)!"
    },
    {
      "source": "동아출판 프라임 영한사전",
      "matchType": "allterm:proximity:1.000000",
      "translatedText": "그의 얼굴은 알고 있다",
